{"server":"tw","storyId":"act10d5_level_act10d5_st02","groupId":"act10d5","stageId":null,"title":"被選擇的","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act10d5/level_act10d5_st02.txt","sourceHash":"5b3b3ec9070a7cea2b118a6849e6c5a66b485e9dfe080263a382902334d50584","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"真理在宿舍內嘗試自我診療，正巧此時幹員梅敲門拜訪。\n與梅一同前來的，還有烏薩斯學生自治團中的另一成員娜塔莉婭。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"真理 被选择的"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"電源，接上了，沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"在錄了嗎？啊——啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好像沒問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"該說點什麼好呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我使用的這台器械，是可露希爾小姐租借給我的，用途是......嗯，申請書上寫的用途是“真實情境暴露式創傷記錄自我診療”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......好長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，機械的操作很方便，只要確認電量充足，然後打開開關......像這樣，就會自動開始錄影了。嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（好難，自說自話好難。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（只是自己對著螢幕說話，本來還以為會比較簡單呢......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"在我提出想要嘗試去緩和與克制自己的症狀時，醫療部的幹員向我提出了這樣的建議——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"“要不要試試看自我傾訴”......這樣的建議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，雖然現在是開著錄影，但這些並不是會給別人看的東西。不如說，我絕不想給任何人看到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"放輕鬆，真理，放輕鬆。嗯嗯，只是隨便說點什麼，不要緊張，給自己聽，想說什麼都行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些現在還沒有辦法說給別人聽的事，可以一遍一遍說給自己聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得，這是一個可行的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"關於之前的一些事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"就算現在大家看起來都還沒什麼問題，但是我知道，我們有很多東西要解決，只是遲早的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，古米也好早露也好，都沒能忘記之前的那些事，在學校裡發生的那些，徹底離開學校之後發生的那些，不會有人忘得掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬她......凜冬她最近好像總是在做噩夢，烈夏看起來很放得下，但是真的......可以放得下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我呢？我又是怎麼樣呢，我認為我可以面對，但是，我真的......可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都閉口不談，可是，不論如何，最後總歸還是要面對。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......真難啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......好吧，我覺得我好像逐漸有一點習慣這樣自言自語了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"正式開始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，或許應該從自我介紹開始？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫做“真理”——當然，這只是個代號，本名是安娜·莫羅佐娃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯，總覺得有很久沒有提過這個名字了，明明是自己的名字，卻有點陌生，真奇怪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"這位是薇卡，是我的好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"薇卡她，是我在加入學生自治團前，最好的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我居住於羅德島這個組織的本營內，隸屬於“烏薩斯學生自治團”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，學生自治團，雖然是我的提議，但真正組建它的人是凜冬。以及，雖說是一個獨立的團體，目前成員也不過只有五個人而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬，娜塔莉婭，烈夏，古米，還有我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"之前其實還有更多的成員，不過現在只剩下我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，當然，薇卡她也是我們之中的一員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"目前我們都作為羅德島的“幹員”......應該算是在工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得這樣不壞。勞有所得，這很公平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬暫時不打算離開這裡，雖然她不說，但我知道她也不討厭這樣。有時我也會想，或許我們就這樣一直走下去也不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，雖然現在大家聚在一起，但我們五個人並不是同一所學校的學生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我和古米，還有娜塔莉婭，是同一所高中的學生，而凜冬還有烈夏屬於另一所學校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，雖然不是同校，但是凜冬從過去起就一直很出名，市內相鄰的幾所學校，沒有學生不認識她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......我認為她是那種天生就適合成為領袖的類型。實際上，她也的確理所應當一樣做著我們的領頭人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們都毫無防備的時候，整合運動進攻、並佔領了我們的城市切爾諾伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了一些......事情，整合運動佔領城區時，我所在的學校中的一部分學生，被強行押送到了凜冬她們所在的校園。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"或許還有其他學校的學生也被聚集到了一起，我不清楚，那時候所有的一切都很混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不清楚他們這樣做的用意，為首的那個整合運動頭目，是個白頭髮的少年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來沒有多大年紀，他是不是還沒有我們大？我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"他似乎用一套什麼理由說服了在場的其他頭目，將許多學生帶走，我們都被關在了凜冬他們的學校內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"現在回想起來，真是太荒唐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，是長達十數天的封鎖，以及......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_5"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_school"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_schoolyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼，太好了，幸好來的人是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉我一把，安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......安娜？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......以及爭鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"被封鎖在校園內的爭鬥，還有徹底脫離校園後，在整個切爾諾伯格城區中的爭鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我們每個人，都有一些不得不去面對的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個時間，應該不是古米，那會是誰......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"請稍等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個錄影，關閉之前的保存操作有點麻煩，就這麼放著應該也沒問題吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"請問是哪位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我啦是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊？預備探員真理小姐！你是不是在裝傻，我的聲音你怎麼可能聽不出來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯，好吵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，之前也說過了，我並不是什麼預備探員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，你們的關係真好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，安娜，我也一起來叨擾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"給，紅茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好香啊，哼哼，看來是很不錯的茶葉嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，剛剛那麼久沒開門，真理你是在忙嗎？我是不是打擾到你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果很忙的話，我之後再來也行，反正也只是來還書給你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是什麼特別要緊的事情，不要在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的，根據我的瞭解，既然安娜本人這麼說，那就不用介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜是不會在這種事情上說謊的。對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，那就好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不過，沒想到你居然還有鎖門的習慣，還真謹慎啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯不錯，看來你已經具備身為一個預備探員應有的謹慎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"停一下，我可不是什麼預備探員，請你不要瞎說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，門只是剛才碰巧有點事情才鎖上的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，安娜的確平常也會習慣性鎖上門吧？畢竟你可是我們之中最謹慎的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭，你就不要取笑我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，抱歉抱歉，因為安娜的表情太可愛了，一不小心就。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀，不管怎麼說，果然下午還是該喝紅茶，嗯嗯，真是太棒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真是喜歡紅茶啊......現在你臉上的表情，就像是被烤化了的乾酪一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？欸？那是什麼形容啊？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，就是很傻的意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什麼啊，太過分了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼！算了，還不快快感謝心胸寬大的本偵探，看，我有給你帶餅乾來哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，餅乾？唔嗯，稍微有點意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"意外什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，沒有想到你居然能想到要帶點心來，我還以為你只會來蹭紅茶呢。嗯，是我誤會你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪是那種人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"看仔細了，這可是我特別為你準備的謝禮！芙蓉特製蔬菜烤餅——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"好，請回吧，請你現在立刻回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，立刻，出門右轉。不送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，不要這麼抗拒，這次的蔬菜烤餅味道很清爽，非常不錯哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"來，你嘗嘗看這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了......等等、住手，我自己會吃的，你別塞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔，唔唔唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，啊哈哈哈，安娜和梅小姐的關係真好，我都有點羡慕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理&梅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請不要亂說，誰和她關係好了！/嘿嘿，挺好的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也不算關係很差，還不錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"是我記錯了，我和她關係一點都不好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理&梅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"？？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜、娜塔莉婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，噗嗤，哈哈哈，對、對不起，但是，但是你們明明就很有默契嘛，噗，阿哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"笑得太誇張了，真是的。算了......那，梅是來還書的，娜塔莉婭你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我嗎，我最近有在考慮一些事情，所以想和真理討論一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？是什麼很重要的事情嗎？......真難得，你居然會想到要來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我可是一直都很想親近安娜你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，也不是什麼特別重要的事，我們之後再說也可以，現在就好好享受下午茶的時間吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，等一等，梅！小心一些，別端著紅茶亂蹦亂跳，會灑出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我又不是小孩子了，才不會灑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，因為沒想到會有人來，房間裡稍微有點亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"宿舍裡沒有什麼可以正經招待大家的地方，娜塔莉婭也別站著了，像梅一樣隨便找喜歡的地方坐就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就不客氣啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不過的確，羅德島提供的宿舍雖然該有的傢俱都會有，也很乾淨整潔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但要是想要像以前招待朋友到家裡來聚會那樣，果然還是不行呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一等，娜塔莉婭，我認為你說的那不是聚會，而是宴會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，宴會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"差很多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，開宴會啊，聽起來就感覺很厲害的樣子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，沒有那麼誇張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"都已經是過去的事情了。不管是大房子還是那樣的生活，都已經和現在的我沒有關係了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭她也是，總拿這個取笑我，明明她心裡也很清楚。這個人說話總是不好聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有安娜在的話，我看索尼婭她恐怕要和不少人都起衝突，唉，真沒辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我其實覺得現在住的還是挺不錯的，比起我之前奉命潛入調查的時候，可好了百倍不止呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，我說啊，真理你的房間明明已經很乾淨了吧！雖然書很多，但都非常整齊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因為平時姑且還有在收拾。而且，古米在衛生這方面一直很嚴格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這樣說來，古米她的確是一直都很喜歡整理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是在當時那樣的環境下，也還是會把收集回來的東西全都一個個收拾好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"現在也一樣，完全沒有改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"當時那樣的環境......?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，有這樣的室友，真不知道是該說幸福好，還是辛苦好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，擺在這裡的這個娃娃是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，這個不可以碰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"幹、幹嘛，嚇了我一跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"不用這麼急著搶也可以吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"對、不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，這個，是對我來說很重要的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這個是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜，這是那個人的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你還帶著這個娃娃，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"請別說了，娜塔莉婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"別說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，嗯，別擔心，我沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......安娜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"別說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"當初的那件事，我也有所耳聞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，那是沒有辦法的，沒人能預想到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"別說了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......雖然很遺憾，但我們大家都知道，那不是你的錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"別再說了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是遲了一步，你已經盡力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，謝謝你。不用擔心，娜塔莉婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我沒事的。\n一直以來，我總和所有人這樣說。\n凜冬、古米、烈夏、娜塔莉婭......大家都相信我會沒事。\n就連我自己，好像差點都要相信了。\n不是我的錯。\n不是我的錯嗎？\n我只是來遲了。\n不，我沒有來遲。\n我盡力了。\n......我盡力了。\n——我早已做出了選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這本小說！是不是我借的這個偵探系列的完結篇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，你說這一本。沒有錯，看來你的確很有眼光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"這是這個系列小說裡最珍貴的一本，舉世無雙的大偵探的最後一幕......哼哼，是我拜託博士幫忙找了好久，才找到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......這樣說起來，我之前回老家的時候，似乎在家裡的書架上看到過附帶作者簽名的初版來著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"好懷念，最初讀的時候我大哭了一場呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"簽名，而且還是初版......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗯，好像有點不妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得索尼婭她之前提起過，安娜為了弄到一本這位作者的簽名版作品，費了不少功夫，但結果還是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有辦法，畢竟是很難得的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟糕，莫非真的有這麼珍貴？？老家這方面的東西太多，一時失察！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那個，真理！呃，對了，這本書，能借給我嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以是可以，但是，你不是之前看過了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"而且還是帶有簽名的初版（小聲）。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛......呃，雖然看過，但是都過去這麼久了，我正好想要重溫哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"居、居然在真理你這裡能看到這本書，哈哈哈，真是太幸運了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你都這麼說了，那......這次就借給你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶！真理，你真是個好人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼......這樣就沒問題了吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"做得這麼明顯，要照顧別人的情緒，這還欠缺點火候呢。（小聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不過還是......謝謝。（小聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你剛剛說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這個蔬菜餅乾真的蠻好吃的欸，真理你不吃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我什麼也沒說，別在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不是什麼奇怪的味道嗎？好吧，讓我也嘗嘗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，梅你會和娜塔莉婭一起還真是少見，我怎麼不記得你們認識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......雖然不是很熟，不過，上次在秘密調查企鵝物流的時候，有被娜塔莉婭小姐幫助過一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡，很高興能夠幫上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"調查企鵝物流？啊，是你常提的，真意外，你居然還沒放棄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不會放棄呢！賭上皇家偵探的名譽——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我個人認為，皇家偵探的名譽應該早就被你賠光了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！哼，我才不和你計較！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，這次我們只是在來的路上偶然碰上而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"比起那個，你上次借我的那本小說也太好看了吧？剛剛看完，我現在就是很想趕快和人一起討論！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，倒也不是不可以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我也好久沒和別人聊過偵探小說了，之前借你的那本小說，裡面有我很喜歡的詭計呢，怎麼樣，很精彩吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"簡直太棒了！作者到底是怎麼想出這種詭計的？嗚啊我看到結局揭露真相的時候，簡直汗毛都要豎起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯，沒錯，將推理要素和文學創作結合起來，並且從現實心理上影響到讀者，這一本是這個系列裡我最喜歡的一本哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——我懂，我完全能夠理解！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"以第一人稱進行創作，兇手正是小說主——唔，唔唔唔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"笨蛋！怎麼可以隨便暴露真凶！娜塔莉婭她還沒看過這本！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"噗——哈！差、差點憋死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔，好疼，我都咬到舌頭了，不小心劇透的確是我不對，但真理你下手也太重了吧唔呃呃呃呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來很有趣，安娜真的很喜歡偵探小說，很少見你說話時這麼興奮哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，是、是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，嗯......這麼有趣的話，下次也請讓我也讀讀看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭你也有興趣了？有點意外呢，明明之前我推薦給你的時候，你都只會說“下次有空一定”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這個嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"看大家聊得這麼開心，我也會想要加入話題嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好吧。不管怎麼說，小說同好能增加，我是很歡迎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟在這裡，能一起聊這方面作品的人實在太少了啦......博士倒是也會讀，但是那個人太忙了，很難有機會抓到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......啊，是那位指揮官閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，果然娜塔莉婭小姐也知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，畢竟那一位在艦船上也比較特殊，而且，我也有拜見過那位指揮官進行戰地指揮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，真是太遺憾了，今天他們好像也在開什麼會議的樣子，我本來還想把餅乾也分博士一些的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"別操心了，芙蓉小姐一定會替博士留一份的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，博士的狀態雖說有凱爾希醫生在監控，但是可以看得出，大家都還是對此很關心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"特別是醫療組的幹員們，最近我去測試的時候，還聽幾位醫生在商量如何管控博士的飲食均衡，嗯......首先，先沒收博士的零食？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，那些東西被沒收也不奇怪吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......古米也和我抱怨過這個，真是的，那個人平常都在吃些什麼呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，娜塔莉婭你說的測試，是指？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，關於這件事，請先容我保密，我還沒有完全拿定主意......今天過來，其實也和這件事有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"今天還是算了，嗯，看起來，今天這個場合不太合適。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，再過不久，安娜你就會知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，既然你這麼說，那麼我就不多問了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，言歸正傳，娜塔莉婭，就先從一些經典的作品開始讀如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，居然又繞回到這個話題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，畢竟這可是向別人推薦自己喜歡的東西的大好機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不會讓這個話題就這麼輕易被帶過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......能感受到熱情呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"那是當然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小看偵探小說，不論種類，優秀的作品中總是寄宿著靈魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，的確是很有安娜風格的發言。不過，嗯，你說的對，這一點我也很贊同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然去思考小說中的詭計，也是樂趣之一，不過我認為偵探小說的魅力絕不僅於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"真理你說的的確沒錯啦，但是要我說的話，果然我最喜歡還是偵探揭穿犯人真面目的那一瞬間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"要說經典的話，果然還是“那個”吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"“那個”？你是指......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"就是“那個”！“那個”呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"“真相只有一個，兇手就是——你！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這個我也知道哦，是名偵探一定會說的台詞之一呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，不管聽多少次，都還是會讓人熱血沸騰的台詞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"的確是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在我看來，在找到犯人之後，才是真正有趣的，需要思考的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，梅，我問你，在找出犯人，抵達真相之後，偵探要怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"當著眾人的面說出真相，以此來給對方定罪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"就算真相為人所知，但有時法律卻已經拿罪人無可奈何，這種時候，又能怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"是就這麼看著罪人逍遙法外，還是，自己作為審判者，採取行動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這是在現實中也存在，很不好解決的問題呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是我的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼啊，你只是想問這個嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底在說什麼傻話，真理，你今天怪怪的，是不是有哪裡不舒服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"......奇怪了，也沒發燒啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是找出真相的偵探，之後的事情當然是交給真正的警察去解決啊？偵探不是萬能的，你可不要誤會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"偵探、警察和法官，各自的職責都不同，這是常識吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛，你這是什麼表情，有這麼吃驚嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，偵探沒有權力給別人定罪，這我當然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，從你的嘴裡聽到常識，還是挺讓人意外的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"等下？喂喂，你什麼意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，自言自語而已，請不要在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，雖然在現在的環境下，成天打打殺殺的人也不少，謀殺不謀殺什麼的可能好多人早就已經不在意了，我這麼說也有點微妙啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算是這樣，我們偵探所能做的，充其量也就是找出真相，維護法律而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有裁決的權利，更加無法凌駕法律之上，私刑什麼的更是不行，不可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"惡事就是惡事，對他人的傷害，不管用怎樣的理由來包裹，也都只是侵犯與傷害而已，行為的本質是不會變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"的確，是這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是否為人知，不管會不會受裁決，做過的事情，至少自己絕對忘不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"偵探要做的，就是把這些埋藏的真相全部挖掘出來！唔，嗯嗯，你不覺得光是說出口，就非常帥氣嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"做過的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不論是出於什麼樣的理由，不論是否暴露於世人眼中，已經發生過的事情是不會變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"總有一天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，話題怎麼好像變得沉重起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我不該提起這種討論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不會哦，我在一邊聽也覺得是很有意義的討論。不過，難得的下午茶時間，接下來還是來聊些輕鬆點的話題吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這是個好主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，茶都涼掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？咦，那個是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，梅？你從剛剛起，就靠在那邊看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那個啊，你們看，窗外那是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？窗外？有什麼東西嗎，我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......那邊有什麼東西在飛，啊，飛過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來，好像是一架無人機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......還真的是無人機......為什麼會在這種地方，等等，它好像掛在外簷上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，在艦船上應該不會有危險吧？既然沒危險，就別想這麼多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"笨蛋！幹嘛跳上去......危險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，拿到了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，梅小姐，小心腳下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_schoolyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼，太好了，幸好來的人是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那一天，她就那樣滑落。\n身體微微揚起，風吹過長髮，乾淨得和周圍格格不入，乾淨得讓我覺得，好像這段時間所發生的一切，都只是一場夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉我一把，安娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無法出聲。無法言語。無法動彈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......安娜？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我輕輕觸碰，這個美夢就這樣滑落。\n無聲無息，只在我的指尖留下些許痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，安娜，你要做什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我就這樣看著她墜落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"梅小姐！太不小心了！要不要緊，有沒有哪裡摔傷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"疼疼疼，沒關係沒關係，別擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這無人機上面掛了張紙條！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是給娜塔莉婭小姐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？給我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......讓我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"梅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊，你怎麼了，臉色好差！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？沒有不舒服？別逞強哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"笨蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有人會跳上窗台還掛在屋簷上，就為了去拿一台不知道目的的無人機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"一般來說，有常識的人會選擇用工具，或者讓我用法術也可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我沒想那麼多嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"請你下次多想一想再行動！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"別嚇我啊。笨蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"把手伸出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？不用了吧......我真的沒事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛，你左手在窗台上擦傷了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不要想著隱瞞，在我面前說謊是沒有用的。你這個人真的很好懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"你眼怎麼這麼尖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是“預備探員”——這點觀察力還是要有的，這不是你說的嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃呃呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，傷口不嚴重，這樣擦乾淨，再噴上藥......好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"之後記得找醫療幹員再仔細處理一下，再小的傷口也不能大意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"都說了只是小傷而已，不用這麼緊張！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"不過還是謝謝啦，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（歎氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這個紙條，上面寫的是赫默小姐的傳訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是我之前提到的，關於測試的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，赫默醫生好厲害，怎麼知道我在這裡的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"用無人機的話，應該是有辦法可以做到的吧？從凱爾希醫生往下，醫療部的人都有一手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說也是呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啊，安娜，我得要去一趟醫療部才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒關係，那邊的事情比較重要，你先去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這樣的話，今天我也先告辭啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"書也已經還了，還借到了接下來可以讀的，嗯嗯，圓滿成功！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼圓滿成功啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"下次有機會，大家再一起聊天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一切順利的話......嗯，或許很快就能夠告訴自治團的大家一個好消息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我就期待著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"下次見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"下次見~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"好消息......嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"薇卡，你說，會是什麼好消息呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭，還有凜冬，索尼婭她......如果她們能夠好好相處的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你覺得一定可以？嗯，嗯，我也這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒有忘記過，有關於你的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我忘記，你會怪我嗎？你會怪我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你說不會？我知道這是在騙我。我知道的，薇卡，你在騙我，你根本不可能和我說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"一直和我在一起的你，至今依然在我身邊的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"總有一天，我們都要面對......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是，不是現在，還不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，我還不夠堅強，暫時我還是做不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_133_mm","aliases":["梅"]},{"speakerId":"char_195_glassb","aliases":["真理"]},{"speakerId":"char_197_poca","aliases":["娜塔莉婭"]}]}
